{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter\/setcontentfetchpolicy(__)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Constrains what the item fetches for the phase the break is in, and puts the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"integrator’s own settings back at the hand-back.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime","doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter\/setContentFetchPolicy(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"}],"externalID":"s:18OptiViewAdsRuntime15AVPlayerAdapterC21setContentFetchPolicyyy0abC4Core0hiJ0OF","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"setContentFetchPolicy(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setContentFetchPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OptiViewAdsCore18ContentFetchPolicyO","text":"ContentFetchPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setContentFetchPolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15OptiViewAdsCore18ContentFetchPolicyO","text":"ContentFetchPolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentFetchPolicy"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"policy","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The phase the break is in."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two AVFoundation defaults are wrong while a break holds content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferredForwardBufferDuration"},{"type":"text","text":" of 0 is “automatic”, under which the engine keeps a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live item current with the sliding window — media the ad is replacing — so the pause"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"phase asks for the smallest buffer the API can express instead. And"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"canUseNetworkResourcesForLiveStreamingWhilePaused"},{"type":"text","text":" of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" lets the seekable range"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"go stale (it reported "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nan"},{"type":"text","text":" while paused), which the resume ceiling reads, so playlist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refresh is switched ON for the whole break."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"preferredPeakBitRate"},{"type":"text","text":" is capped at the lowest variant for the pause only. A paused"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"item otherwise walks the ladder down on its own and re-fetches the paused segment on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every rung (42 of 42 pause-phase fetches were down-switches), which also moves the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"seekable range between variants. The run-up and the hand-back put the integrator’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value back, so the cap never limits playback."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime","title":"OptiViewAdsRuntime","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The iOS and tvOS runtime of the OptiView Ads SDK: the AVFoundation content-player adapter, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overlay ad renderer, and the Google IMA integrations."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/AVPlayerAdapter/setContentFetchPolicy(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/AVPlayerAdapter\/setContentFetchPolicy(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"setContentFetchPolicy","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OptiViewAdsCore18ContentFetchPolicyO","text":"ContentFetchPolicy"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter\/setcontentfetchpolicy(__)","abstract":[{"text":"Constrains what the item fetches for the phase the break is in, and puts the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"integrator’s own settings back at the hand-back."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"setContentFetchPolicy(_:)"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/AVPlayerAdapter":{"title":"AVPlayerAdapter","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AVPlayerAdapter"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AVPlayerAdapter"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/avplayeradapter","abstr